# Trivy ignore list for the vectant-runtime image (CRITICAL-vuln gate, Slice 1).
# Every entry MUST carry a justification + a revisit condition. Keep this minimal.

# CVE-2026-33186 — google.golang.org/grpc v1.78.0 is vendored into the BASE
# docker:dind-rootless containerd binaries (containerd, ctr, containerd-shim-runc-v2).
# Fixed in grpc 1.79.3, but no docker:dind-rootless base built against it is published
# yet, so it cannot be patched from our Dockerfile. containerd's gRPC API is a LOCAL
# unix socket (/run/containerd/containerd.sock) reachable only by the in-pod dockerd;
# it is never network-exposed, and under Sysbox the pod is isolated — exploitation
# would require prior in-pod RCE (at which point the pod is already compromised).
# REVISIT: drop this line and bump the base digest once a dind-rootless image with
# containerd built against grpc >= 1.79.3 ships.
CVE-2026-33186
